{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"08ebd09ebed9b2b5","type":"group","x":-1600,"y":0,"width":1435,"height":986,"label":"添加搜索功能"},
		{"id":"d68ae41b32fa4b46","type":"group","x":20,"y":20,"width":1217,"height":900,"label":"创建新发票"},
		{"id":"495e376cd5d1c752","type":"group","x":-1600,"y":1040,"width":1435,"height":740,"label":"使用 URL 参数实现分页功能"},
		{"id":"8519b36aa9c3a6ff","type":"text","text":"const params = new URLSearchParams(searchParams)","x":-705,"y":330,"width":380,"height":70},
		{"id":"7cdb8aff866140bc","type":"text","text":"调用params的set方法，将Input值设置为查询参数","x":-705,"y":500,"width":440,"height":60},
		{"id":"57a7dd0aa4b33b33","type":"text","text":"        defaultValue={searchParams.get('query')?.toString()}","x":-705,"y":854,"width":520,"height":52},
		{"id":"571bf36ea1f5490a","type":"text","text":"为什么在Search组件输入，下方表格自动更新？","x":-1520,"y":150,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"43832f73ba334265","type":"text","text":"Search组件输入，replace更新url的查询参数","x":-1520,"y":267,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"f03579a5368eebc1","type":"text","text":"nextjs自动抓取变化的url，打包为searchParams新对象","x":-1520,"y":389,"width":288,"height":83},
		{"id":"24dce419c76b7a8a","type":"text","text":"将打包后的SearchParams作为props传递给page","x":-1520,"y":530,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"1a1ab36489092360","type":"text","text":"Change事件触发调用handleSearch函数","x":-745,"y":160,"width":361,"height":60},
		{"id":"0d53d9b4d8495208","type":"text","text":"replace(`${pathname}?${params.toString()}`);","x":-657,"y":680,"width":425,"height":60},
		{"id":"273ef229978513de","type":"text","text":"用户在Input中输入内容","x":-725,"y":20,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"4f53a5c274c9f7f7","type":"text","text":"实现步骤的简要概述：\n\n1. 捕获用户的输入。\n2. 使用搜索参数更新 URL。\n3. 保持 URL 与输入字段同步。\n4. 更新表格以反映搜索查询。","x":-1195,"y":10,"width":360,"height":200},
		{"id":"220de045b865544c","type":"text","text":"克隆当前的url，将它变成一个可修改的对象","x":-1085,"y":300,"width":250,"height":80},
		{"id":"99138b543fb9be86","type":"text","text":"更新URL","x":-1085,"y":680,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d89ec09d0e167225","type":"text","text":"与URL状态同步，浏览器原生管理表单状态","x":-1085,"y":906,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"e5437385c8688487","type":"text","text":"page路由对数据处理传递给表格组件","x":-1520,"y":660,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"58f5482ff991c367","type":"text","text":"表格组件获取到对应数据，发送请求，组件更新","x":-1520,"y":780,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"a534fa824c49e28e","type":"text","text":"使用 URL 参数实现分页功能：\n\n- **用户点击**：URL 变为 `?page=2`。\n- **Page 响应**：`Page` 组件重新执行，拿到数字 `2`。\n- **数据抓取**：调用数据库函数，跳过前 10 条（假设每页 10 条），取第 11-20 条数据。    \n- **UI 渲染**：`Table` 组件显示第 2 页的数据，`Pagination` 组件高亮数字 2。\n","x":-1580,"y":1060,"width":465,"height":262},
		{"id":"e3741dfe4f1353d8","type":"text","text":"page的props发生变化，重新渲染和执行；将最新的currentPage传递给Table组件","x":-1115,"y":1560,"width":383,"height":78},
		{"id":"0eaa55c4a18895c5","type":"text","text":"将totalPages传递给Pagination组件，用于渲染PaginationNumber","x":-560,"y":1244,"width":322,"height":80},
		{"id":"50190e3b875ca765","type":"text","text":"  const totalPages = await fetchInvoicesPages(query);","x":-560,"y":1060,"width":295,"height":80},
		{"id":"589dab46ddbd28ee","type":"text","text":"传递query参数，查询特定数据，返回查询结果（页数）","x":-960,"y":1060,"width":280,"height":80},
		{"id":"c717aac8e39075c3","type":"text","text":"Table组件的props发生变化，重新执行并发送请求渲染数据，驱动表格更新","x":-568,"y":1680,"width":352,"height":80},
		{"id":"3075ee43da225fea","type":"text","text":"在nextjs中，页面的url发生变化会被nextjs捕捉，整合为SearchParams对象，作为props传递","x":-500,"y":1440,"width":330,"height":100},
		{"id":"f403c2bb24a27220","type":"text","text":"当Pagination组件渲染时执行createPageURL函数","x":-1044,"y":1288,"width":325,"height":72},
		{"id":"ac8b7fb64009e57d","type":"text","text":"params.set('page', pageNumber.toString());\n驱动页面url page参数变化","x":-1086,"y":1430,"width":406,"height":60},
		{"id":"4f1fdcd3a86479b2","type":"text","text":"创建新发票的步骤：\n\n1. 创建一个表单以捕获用户输入。\n2. 创建一个服务器操作，并从表单中调用它。\n3. 在您的服务器操作中，从``formData``对象中提取数据。\n4. 验证并准备要插入到您数据库中的数据。\n5. 插入数据并处理任何错误。\n6. 重新验证缓存并将用户重定向回发票页面。","x":40,"y":40,"width":484,"height":257},
		{"id":"1b068f55157d503d","type":"text","text":"用到的知识点：\n\n1. Server Action\n2. redirct函数\n3. zod校验数据\n4. revalidatePath(URL)清除缓存","x":40,"y":320,"width":320,"height":220},
		{"id":"3bcc65401e843cf9","type":"text","text":"用户在表单输入数据，点击保存","x":640,"y":40,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"b869e0e01b4a0771","type":"text","text":"操作数据库存储数据","x":465,"y":440,"width":300,"height":60},
		{"id":"a8f550d45da1656f","type":"text","text":"接收表单传入的dormData数据，并且利用zod校验数据是否合法","x":590,"y":280,"width":300,"height":80},
		{"id":"843f114a5bc8ffc1","type":"text","text":"form表单调用action属性里传入的server action操作","x":610,"y":169,"width":260,"height":81},
		{"id":"890477430a743d34","type":"text","text":"为什么要重新验证缓存？\n\n因为nextjs的缓存机制，例如：当Link组件出现在浏览器的视口时，nextjs会在后台下载对应页面所需要的数据，这样跳转时，浏览器从缓存里拿数据，页面时秒开的，不需要获取数据了；\n\n但这样会导致一个问题，页面渲染是从缓存里拿数据，并不是重新发送请求，这样数据库更新并不会反映在视图上，因此需要手动清除对应页面缓存","x":870,"y":720,"width":325,"height":180},
		{"id":"1e1b2ee18aaee9e2","type":"text","text":"注意：\n在 Server Action 执行完写操作后，必须显式调用 `revalidatePath`。","x":890,"y":450,"width":327,"height":100},
		{"id":"76a2dda6bd6d8c9f","type":"text","text":"重新验证缓存并将用户重定向回发票页面。","x":380,"y":680,"width":299,"height":60},
		{"id":"96bd234f8c0b34fa","x":10,"y":1294,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"配置auth.config.ts文件"},
		{"id":"c3fc53509750a235","x":447,"y":1294,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"配置auth.ts文件"},
		{"id":"82e1475c92541bc7","x":41,"y":1010,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"添加登录认证功能"},
		{"id":"9d7d0870c7f8be2c","x":166,"y":1110,"width":312,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"生成密钥，密钥用来加密cookie"},
		{"id":"9c1795f7dd30e7a5","x":572,"y":960,"width":420,"height":140,"type":"text","text":"cookie是什么？\n\nCookie 就是由服务器发送并存储在你的浏览器（客户端）上的一小段文本数据，相当于身份证"},
		{"id":"7f17bd9fda209b46","x":572,"y":1154,"width":420,"height":90,"type":"text","text":"Session是什么？\n\n"}
	],
